{"title":"Opal","slug":"Opal","pageid":2278,"revid":14228,"timestamp":"2024-08-06T06:44:56Z","lastEditor":"XXDark29","categories":["Candidates_for_deletion"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"opal","text":"Opal"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p><span>Candidate for Deletion</span><br>\n<i>This article has been nominated for removal from the wiki. Reason: There are more detailed pages.<br>Remember to check <span data-unresolved=\"1\"><u>what links here</u></span> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Opal?action=history\"><u>the page history</u></a> before deletion.</i></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>The <b>Opal</b> ore consists of 3 different variants, the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalRed/\">OpalRed</a> only growing in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Red_Clay/\">Red Clay</a>, the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBlue/\">OpalBlue</a> growing in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blue_Clay/\">Blue Clay</a> and the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBrown/\">OpalBrown</a> growing in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Brown_Clay/\">Brown Clay</a>. All of them are located in Ferwater and are uncommon ores.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"opal\">Opal</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Price\n<p>(Raw)\n</p>\n</th>\n<th>Price\n<p>(Refined)\n</p>\n</th>\n<th>Price\n<p>(Forged)\n</p>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RawBlOpal\">RawBlOpal</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBlue/\"><b>Blue Opal</b></a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$5/Stud\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$46/stud\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\">$52/stud\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RawBrOpal\">RawBrOpal</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBrown/\"><b>Brown Opal</b></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RawReOpal\">RawReOpal</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalRed/\"><b>Red Opal</b></a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n</div>"}
